*.tar.gz
*.apk

# ☠️ CALL LOGS ARE NOT COMMITTED. Even scrubbed of MSISDN, IMSI, IMEI and
# ICCID, a call log records WHEN its owner telephoned, and the radio-quality
# stream beside it records the conditions they were in while doing so. That is
# personal data about a person, not a measurement of a phone, and this
# repository is shared. The FINDING - the timing table, the decoded
# AccessTechnologies values, the analysis - belongs in a capture README; the
# raw log belongs on local disk. Kept as a rule in code because the same
# mistake was made by hand on 2026-09-08.
callwatch*.log
*-callwatch*.log
